<import src="../../templates/rows.wxml"/><view class="app theme-{{theme}}"><view class="wrap"><view class="intro"><view class="h1">米其林全球名录</view><view class="sub">创建旅行、按城市分组收藏，在地图上查看沿途想吃的餐厅。</view></view><view class="travel-map-title">旅行美食地图</view><view class="journey-tools"><picker range="{{tripNames}}" bindchange="selectTrip"><view class="trip-picker">{{selectedName||'选择旅行'}} ▾</view></picker><picker range="{{cities}}" value="{{cityIndex}}" bindchange="selectCity"><view class="trip-picker">{{cities[cityIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><view class="action primary" bindtap="newTrip">＋ 创建旅行</view></view><view class="journey-banner"><text>{{selectedName||'把想吃的，放进旅程。'}}</text><text>{{places.length}} 家餐厅</text></view><view class="map-frame"><view class="map-heading"><view><view class="map-kicker">EXPLORE THE TABLE</view><view class="map-hint">上下滑动页面，查看下方餐厅</view></view><view class="action" bindtap="toggleInteract">{{interactive?'完成移动':'移动地图'}}</view></view><view class="map-stage"><map id="travelMap" class="travel-map" latitude="{{lat}}" longitude="{{lng}}" scale="{{scale}}" markers="{{markers}}" include-points="{{includePoints}}" enable-scroll="{{interactive}}" enable-zoom="{{interactive}}" bindmarkertap="markerTap"/><view class="map-utilities"><view class="map-util" bindtap="fit">⛶</view></view></view><view class="map-bottom"><text>{{places.length}} 家旅行餐厅</text><text bindtap="listJump">查看餐厅 ↓</text></view></view><view class="legend"><text class="l3">● 三星</text><text class="l2">● 二星</text><text class="l1">● 一星</text><text class="lb">● 必比登</text><text>● 入选</text></view><view id="travel-list"><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!places.length}}">还没有餐厅。在名录中找到感兴趣的餐厅，点“加入旅行”。</view><template is="rows" data="{{groups}}"/></view></view></view>